%% ============================================================
% Evaluation_FWCCA_results_SNR_minus5_5dB_500MonteCarlo.m
%
% Evaluation and figure generation for the main FWCCA simulation study
%
% Input
% -----
%   Results/
%       FWCCA_results_SNR_minus5_5_Gaussian_5neighborhood.mat
%
% Output
% ------
% All figures generated by this script are saved in:
%
%   Figures/
%
% Main manuscript:
%
% Figure 6:
%   Normalized mean estimates of
%   (a) \hat{s}_1 and (b) \hat{s}_2 at SNR = 0 dB.
%
% Figure 7:
%   Bandwidth selection at SNR = 0 dB based on training/testing
%   AUC and local variance across bandwidths for LG-FWCCA and
%   GL-FWCCA.
%
% Figure 9:
%   Testing AUC for SNR levels ranging from -5 dB to 5 dB.
%
% Supplementary material:
%
% Supplementary Figures 1--4:
%   Mean test canonical component maps across SNR levels from
%   -5 dB to 5 dB, excluding 0 dB.
%
% Supplementary Figures 5--8:
%   Histograms of test explained variation (EV_Test).
%
% Supplementary Figures 9--12:
%   Histograms of test absolute reconstruction correlation
%   (RCOR_Test).
%
%% ============================================================

